    <string name="setup_deepseek_title">Need an API Key? View the DeepSeek guide</string>
    <string name="setup_deepseek_step_account">Open the official DeepSeek API platform and sign up or log in. You need a platform API Key, not your chat account password.</string>
    <string name="setup_deepseek_step_balance">Check your API balance and billing details on the platform. Add funds if needed. Huishen does not collect API fees.</string>
    <string name="setup_deepseek_step_key">Go to API Keys and create a new key. You can name it Huishen. Copy the complete key when it is created.</string>
    <string name="setup_deepseek_step_paste">Return to Huishen and paste the key manually into the API Key field. You can keep the default DeepSeek address and model.</string>
    <string name="setup_deepseek_step_test">Save your configuration and test the connection. Next, generate reminders in the tutorial to verify that model requests work too.</string>
